<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Discord Economy Grinder</Major>
    <Description>this is a macro set to auto grind on discord.
it is default set to work on 2 discord accounts at the same time (one in the discord app one in a search enginge.
just put the 2 discord tabs side by side in window mode then relocate the curser to the type section on both tabs
if you want it for just 1 discord tab then delete the first half up until the cursor locate
then you can run it.
change the /' command to whatever you want its set to a 30s delay between runs currently you can also change that.
screen resolution is set to 1920 x 1080p

Step 1) Load discord on 1 or 2 accounts
Step 2) Reposition Curser starting point to the type bar in your window
Step 3) replace /work with your command or leave it
Step 4) If you only want to run it on one discord account then delete the first half or replace with a second command
Step 5) change the delay at the end to whatever time the cooldown is on the discord bot
Step 6) Enjoy

</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 
</Comment>
